{"schema":1,"locale":"zh-Hans","created_at":"2026-11-28T19:07:22.433Z","entries":{"docs-7.25\u0000## routing/isis/interface **Type:** Directory":"## routing/isis/interface \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## routing/isis/interface-template **Type:** Directory":"## routing/isis/interface-template \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## routing/isis/lsp **Type:** Directory":"## routing/isis/lsp \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## routing/isis/neighbor **Type:** Directory":"## routing/isis/neighbor \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## routing/nexthop **Type:** Directory":"## routing/nexthop \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## routing/nexthop/dump-dot **Type:** Command":"## routing/nexthop/dump-dot \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.25\u0000## routing/ospf/area **Type:** Directory":"## routing/ospf/area \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## routing/ospf/area/range **Type:** Directory":"## routing/ospf/area/range \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## routing/ospf/instance **Type:** Directory":"## routing/ospf/instance \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## routing/ospf/interface **Type:** Directory":"## routing/ospf/interface \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## routing/ospf/interface-template **Type:** Directory":"## routing/ospf/interface-template \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## routing/ospf/lsa **Type:** Directory":"## routing/ospf/lsa \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## routing/ospf/neighbor **Type:** Directory":"## routing/ospf/neighbor \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## routing/ospf/static-neighbor **Type:** Directory":"## routing/ospf/static-neighbor \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## routing/pimsm/bsr/candidate **Conditions:** !smips **Type:** Directory":"## routing/pimsm/bsr/candidate \n**条件：** !smips\n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## routing/pimsm/bsr/rp-candidate **Conditions:** !smips **Type:** Directory":"## routing/pimsm/bsr/rp-candidate \n**条件：** !smips\n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000- `simple` - plain text authentication. - `md5` - keyed Message Digest 5 authentication. - `sha*` - HMAC-SHA authentication RFC5709.":"- `simple` - 明文认证。\n- `md5` - 带密钥的 Message Digest 5 认证。\n- `sha*` - HMAC-SHA 认证 RFC5709。","docs-7.25\u0000Default value is 128, keep this in mind if you had strict priorities set for DR/BDR election. </ArgTableRow> <ArgTableRow arg=\"cost\" typ=\"num\">Interface cost expressed as link state metric.</ArgTableRow> <ArgTableRow arg=\"passive\" typ=\"switch\">If enabled, then the router does not send or receive OSPF traffic on the matching interfaces.</ArgTableRow> <ArgTableRow arg=\"auth\" typ=\"enum(simple | md5 | sha1 | sha256 | sha384 | sha512)\" unset=\"1\"> Specifies authentication method for OSPF protocol messages.":"默认值为 128，如果为 DR/BDR 选举设置了严格优先级，请记住这一点。\n</ArgTableRow>\n<ArgTableRow arg=\"cost\" typ=\"num\">接口开销，以链路状态度量值表示。</ArgTableRow>\n<ArgTableRow arg=\"passive\" typ=\"switch\">启用后，路由器不会在匹配的接口上发送或接收 OSPF 流量。</ArgTableRow>\n<ArgTableRow arg=\"auth\" typ=\"enum (simple | md5 | sha1 | sha256 | sha384 | sha512)\" unset=\"1\">\n指定 OSPF 协议消息的认证方法。","docs-7.25\u0000If the parameter is unset, then authentication is not used. </ArgTableRow> <ArgTableRow arg=\"auth-key\" typ=\"string\" unset=\"1\">The authentication key to be used, should match on all the neighbors of the network segment.</ArgTableRow> <ArgTableRow arg=\"auth-id\" typ=\"num\" unset=\"1\">The key id is used to calculate a message digest(used when MD5 or SHA authentication is enabled). The value should match all OSPF routers from the same region.</ArgTableRow> <ArgTableRow arg=\"use-bfd\" typ=\"bool\" unset=\"1\"></ArgTableRow> </ArgTable>":"如果未设置该参数，则不使用认证。\n</ArgTableRow>\n<ArgTableRow arg=\"auth-key\" typ=\"string\" unset=\"1\">要使用的认证密钥，应与网段内所有邻居保持一致。</ArgTableRow>\n<ArgTableRow arg=\"auth-id\" typ=\"num\" unset=\"1\">密钥 id 用于计算消息摘要（启用 MD5 或 SHA 认证时使用）。该值应与同一区域内所有 OSPF 路由器保持一致。</ArgTableRow>\n<ArgTableRow arg=\"use-bfd\" typ=\"bool\" unset=\"1\"></ArgTableRow>\n</ArgTable>","docs-7.25\u0000List of currently active OSPF neighbors.":"当前活动的 OSPF 邻居列表。","docs-7.25\u0000Static configuration of the OSPF neighbors. Required for non-broadcast multi-access networks.":"OSPF 邻居的静态配置。非广播多路访问网络必需。","docs-7.25\u0000The interface template defines common network and interface matches and what parameters to assign to a matched interface.":"接口模板定义通用网络和接口匹配条件，以及分配给匹配接口的参数。"}}
